Package: backlightd
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: ShellCode33 <shellcode33@proton.me>
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPENDS@, systemd, udev
Homepage: https://github.com/ShellCode33/backlightd
Description: Coordinated laptop and external monitor brightness
 A Linux daemon and CLI for sysfs backlights and DDC/CI monitors,
 with configurable automatic schedules and per-monitor calibration.
